  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**75 ÷ 30 - (3)/(4)of( {(5)/(7) ÷ (9)/({14)}} ) - ( {3(1)/(3) - 1(2)/(3)} ) **\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5e63fc1c03cdbd2b9dc2c6c2bc826baad649423eaf5d2ca75ecab076139d99e7.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ **75 ÷ 30 - (3)/(4)of( {(5)/(7) ÷ (9)/({14)}} ) - ( {3(1)/(3) - 1(2)/(3)} )**\n\n⇒ 75 ÷ 30 - (3)/(4)of( {(5)/(7) times (14)/({9)}} ) - ( {(10)/(3) - (5)/(3)} )\n\n⇒ 75 ÷ 30 - (3)/(4)of( {(10)/(9) {{}}} ) - ( {(5)/(3)} )\n\n⇒ 75 ÷ 30 - (15)/(18) - {(5)/(3)} \n\n⇒ (75)/(30) - (15)/(18) - {(5)/(3)} \n\n⇒ (5)/(2) - (5)/(6) - {(5)/(3)} \n\n⇒ ((15 - 5 - 10))/(6) \n\n⇒ ((15 - 15))/(6) \n\n⇒ 0\n\n**∴ The required answer is 0.**\n\n1a5:T",
